WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.700 line:7% align:center
Today we are at the kidney unit
of Thabet Thabet Hospital.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:09.200 line:7% align:center
Today we are carrying out an activity
to serve patients on dialysis,

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:13.500 line:7% align:center
who are suffering the most
in Tulkarm governorate,

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.900 line:7% align:center
under the siege in Tulkarm,
with incursions, closures and everything else.

5
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.600 line:7% align:center
Today we thank Sayidet Falasteen,
the Sayidet Falasteen association,

6
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:26.550 line:7% align:center
for supporting kidney patients
and for visiting them today,

7
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.100 line:7% align:center
especially kidney patients,
the most important group in our community.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200 line:7% align:center
Here there are 180 patients
who struggle with transport,

9
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:35.350 line:7% align:center
who struggle with many things,
with their many needs.

10
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.150 line:7% align:center
We thank you for this kind gesture.

11
00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:41.100 line:7% align:center
I thank Ms. Nadeen Ayoub,
the head of the association,

12
00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:46.350 line:7% align:center
for her generous gesture to Tulkarm
and the kidney unit at Thabet Thabet Hospital.

13
00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:53.350 line:7% align:center
The least we can do is thank her
for caring about our 180 patients in Tulkarm,

14
00:00:53.350 --> 00:00:57.900 line:7% align:center
who suffer greatly from the hard situation
in Tulkarm, and the siege.
